# File Placer Parity Plan

## Goal
Achieve feature parity with the legacy Tkinter "File Placer" tab. This involves displaying missing configuration files (Drawing Layers) and making the UI functional (Uploading separate config files, Deleting training images).

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> The Web GUI replaces "Select File Path..." (local file selection) with "Upload File" (server upload). This is a fundamental difference in architecture but achieves the same goal of updating the project configuration.

## Proposed Changes

### Backend ([src/server.py](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/QualiaQC/src/server.py) & [src/project_management/manager.py](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/QualiaQC/src/project_management/manager.py))

#### [MODIFY] [src/server.py](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/QualiaQC/src/server.py)
-   **Update [get_project_files](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/QualiaQC/src/server.py#99-130)**:
    -   Iterate through `technical_drawing_paths` from [manager.py](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/QualiaQC/src/project_management/manager.py).
    -   Append them to the `config_files` list response.
-   **New Endpoint `DELETE /api/projects/{project_id}/dataset/images/{filename}`**:
    -   Delete the physical file from `dataset/training_images`.
    -   Update `dataset_item_processing_config.json` to remove the image entry.
    -   Clear project cache.
-   **New Endpoint `POST /api/projects/{project_id}/files/upload`**:
    -   Accepts [file](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/QualiaQC/Dockerfile), `category` (enum: ideal_checker, project_checker, object_ref, aruco_ref, drawing_layer), and optional `layer_key`.
    -   Saves the file to the project's asset directory.
    -   Updates `project_config.json` with the new path.

### Frontend ([web-gui/src/features/dataset/FilePlacer.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/QualiaQC/web-gui/src/features/dataset/FilePlacer.tsx))

#### [MODIFY] [FilePlacer.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/QualiaQC/web-gui/src/features/dataset/FilePlacer.tsx)
-   **Visual Updates**:
    -   Render "Drawing Layers" in the configuration list.
    -   Change the "ExternalLink" icon to an "Upload" icon for config files.
-   **Interactivity**:
    -   Implement **Delete** for training images: Wire the trash icon to the DELETE endpoint.
    -   Implement **Upload** for config files:
        -   Add a hidden file input.
        -   On button click, trigger file input.
        -   On file change, upload using the new POST endpoint.
        -   Invalidate query to refresh list.

